@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Direction — Bến Thành → Nguyễn Huệ (default bike = làn xe máy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/directions
    ?origin=10.7721,106.6980
    &destination=10.7741,106.7042

### Direction — alias motorbike → bike
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/directions
    ?origin=10.7721,106.6980
    &destination=10.7741,106.7042
    &vehicle=1

### Direction — car (làn ô tô)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/directions
    ?origin=10.7721,106.6980
    &destination=10.7741,106.7042
    &vehicle=0

### Direction — thiếu origin (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/directions
    ?destination=10.7741,106.7042
